@*
    _PrintBase.cshtml — 列印共用「簽核區」區塊（製作/審核/核准/日期，本地化）。
    這四欄在各 Print 視圖完全相同；集中於此一處，語系切換即時生效，新單據不需再抄。

    名字取自 ViewBag.PrintSign（Controller 呼叫 PreparePrintSignAsync；規則見 PrintSignatureService：
    一位核准者印「核准」、多位時最後一位印「核准」其餘印「審核」）；沒有的格子留白供手簽。
    「日期」印列印當下的廠別時間（ViewBag.PrintTime，PreparePrintViewBagAsync 以廠別時區算好）。

    用法（放在各 Print.cshtml 明細/合計之後）：
        @@await Html.PartialAsync("_PrintBase")
*@
@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Localization.IStringLocalizer<SmartFactory.MES.ProjectZSharedResource> L
@{
    var sign = ViewBag.PrintSign as SmartFactory.MES.Modules._Shared.Printing.PrintSignature
               ?? SmartFactory.MES.Modules._Shared.Printing.PrintSignature.Blank;
    var printedAt = (ViewBag.PrintTime as DateTime?)?.ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm") ?? "";
}
<div class="print-section">
    <div class="print-sign-area">
        <div><div class="print-field-label">@L["Print_Sign_Created"]</div><div class="print-sign-line d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">@sign.Created</div></div>
        <div><div class="print-field-label">@L["Print_Sign_Reviewed"]</div><div class="print-sign-line d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">@sign.Reviewed</div></div>
        <div><div class="print-field-label">@L["Print_Sign_Approved"]</div><div class="print-sign-line d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">@sign.Approved</div></div>
        <div><div class="print-field-label">@L["Print_Sign_Date"]</div><div class="print-sign-line d-flex align-items-end justify-content-center">@printedAt</div></div>
    </div>
</div>
